00:17:17.100 --> 00:17:26.480
Well, as this episode begins, Joe Bennett, CEO of Saber, who bought Dunder Mifflin sight unseen, is coming in.
那么，这一集开始时，Saber公司的首席执行官乔·贝内特（Joe Bennett）——也就是那个没看实物就买下邓德·米夫林（Dunder Mifflin）的人——要来了。

371
00:17:26.580 --> 00:17:28.300
And it's Kathy Bates, folks.
而且扮演者是凯西·贝茨（Kathy Bates），各位。

372
00:17:28.580 --> 00:17:29.840
And everyone is prepping.
大家都在做准备。

373
00:17:30.060 --> 00:17:30.720
They're cleaning.
他们在打扫。

374
00:17:30.960 --> 00:17:31.880
They're tidying up.
他们在整理。

375
00:17:32.080 --> 00:17:32.660
Yeah.
是的。

376
00:17:33.160 --> 00:17:35.160
Aaron puts out some Lifesaver candies.
亚伦（Aaron）摆出了一些救生圈糖果。

377
00:17:35.560 --> 00:17:39.380
Jim puts his Saber water bottle front and center on his desk.
吉姆（Jim）把他的Saber水瓶放在了办公桌最显眼的位置。

378
00:17:39.640 --> 00:17:39.960
Mm-hmm.
