00:17:59.380 --> 00:18:02.580
I noticed it right away, and I was like, oh, she's amazing.
我一眼就注意到了，当时我就想，噢，她太棒了。

388
00:18:02.880 --> 00:18:03.880
She's amazing.
她太棒了。

