00:18:08.300 --> 00:18:18.940
In Booze Cruise, Michael stood on the bow and said, I am the king of the world, indicating that he has seen the movie Titanic, which Kathy Bates was in.
这算是一个连续性错误吗？因为，我是说，迈克尔难道认不出乔·贝内特就是凯西·贝茨吗？

392
00:18:19.520 --> 00:18:26.660
Is this a continuity error since, I mean, wouldn't Michael recognize that Joe Bennett is Kathy Bates?
嗯，我思考过这个问题。

