你问过兰迪了吗？

433
00:20:26.900 --> 00:20:27.980
I did ask Randy.
我确实问过兰迪。

434
00:20:28.260 --> 00:20:28.860
Oh, Lord.
天哪。

435
00:20:28.860 --> 00:20:29.580
What's the answer?
答案是什么？

436
00:20:29.880 --> 00:20:31.900
Well, it was a very long process.
嗯，这是一个非常漫长的过程。

437
00:20:32.120 --> 00:20:33.240
Oh, my gosh.
天呐。

438
00:20:34.420 --> 00:20:43.500
So, first, they had to budget two full days of meet and greet for both Kathy Bates and Ed Helms to bond with the dogs.
首先，他们必须专门安排整整两天的时间，让凯西·贝茨和埃德·赫尔姆斯与这些狗进行接触和磨合。

439
00:20:43.500 --> 00:20:50.340
Because these were the two people that the dogs would be having their, like, primary interactions with.
因为这两个人是与狗进行主要互动的人。

440
00:20:50.340 --> 00:20:55.560
And it's funny because remember when Ed had to skip out a lunch to go spend time with the swans?
有趣的是，还记得埃德有一次不得不推掉午餐去和天鹅相处吗？

441
00:20:55.800 --> 00:20:56.120
I do.
记得。

442
00:20:56.300 --> 00:20:58.680
Now he had to go spend time with these dogs.
现在他又得去和这些狗相处了。

443
00:20:59.500 --> 00:21:10.260
Well, Randy said we needed four more days of prep where the trainers brought the dogs onto set with Kathy, Ed, and also Zach Woods.
嗯，兰迪说我们还需要四天的准备时间，让驯兽师带着狗和凯西、埃德以及扎克·伍兹一起到片场。

444
00:21:10.260 --> 00:21:16.100
So, by the time we were ready to shoot with them, these dogs were comfortable with the set.
所以，当我们准备好拍摄时，这些狗已经适应了片场环境。

445
00:21:16.200 --> 00:21:17.560
They were comfortable with the people.
它们也适应了那些人。

446
00:21:17.980 --> 00:21:20.920
Here's how they got them into Ed's crotch.
这就是他们让狗去嗅埃德胯下的方法。

447
00:21:21.440 --> 00:21:21.700
Okay.
好吧。

448
00:21:22.360 --> 00:21:29.840
They applied a colorless dog pheromone to Ed's wardrobe to get them to sniff.
他们在埃德的戏服上涂了一种无色的犬类费洛蒙，以此吸引它们去嗅。

449
00:21:30.400 --> 00:21:31.700
Randy said, quote,
兰迪说，引用他的话：

450
00:21:31.880 --> 00:21:33.440
It did what it was supposed to.
它起到了预期的作用。

451
00:21:33.600 --> 00:21:36.480
The Great Danes were in love with Ed's crotch.
